/LinearClone/` is the correct app directory for the current task on the feature/linear-clone branch."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a82e9e1a36a8ee1d4 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 23019\ntool_uses: 7\nduration_ms: 13879</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6fa9cd7c-8c43-483f-9e6a-f39236e8b84e","uuid":"ea51c9ec-1892-486f-b12c-1b353c157017","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app directory for the current task. Look for an app related to \"linear-clone\" or \"ActiveCycle\" or \"CycleList\" or \"CycleDetail\" or \"CreateCycle\" or \"BurndownChart\" in the /repo/apps/ directory. List all directories under /repo/apps/ and find which one is relevant. Then find and list all files in that app's directory, especially AppSpec.md, AppRevisions.md, docs/tests.md, and any mockup images.","agentId":"a82e9e1a36a8ee1d4","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I now have a complete picture of the app directory. Here's my comprehensive report:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Relevant App Directory**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone`\n\nThis is the app related to the \"linear-clone\" feature branch (as shown in your git status). The app directory contains files related to the LinearClone project management application.\n\n## Directory Structure and Files\n\n### Available Files in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`:\n\n1. **AppSpec.md** — `/repo/apps/LinearClone/AppSpec.md`\n   - Comprehensive specification for the LinearClone application\n   - Covers core concepts (Workspace, Team, Project, Issue, Cycle, Label, Member)\n   - Details all pages and features including:\n     - Authentication (Login/Sign Up pages)\n     - Navigation sidebar structure\n     - Issue statuses and priorities\n     - Main pages: My Issues, Inbox, Team Issues, Issue Detail, Active Cycle, Projects, Members, Teams Management, Labels, Settings\n     - Create Issue Modal and keyboard shortcuts\n     - Visual design specifications\n\n2. **docs/tests.md**